{
    "_comment": "Milo at the entrance of Sugarwood Grove (after the Rainbow Fields boss). Still kind, but starts asking questions.",
    "partner": "milo",
    "start": [
        {
            "if": {
                "flag": "talked:milo_candy"
            },
            "goto": "again"
        },
        "first"
    ],
    "nodes": {
        "first": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "talked:milo_candy"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "milo_candy_01",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Hey. Two guards down. People are going to start telling stories about you."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_candy_02",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "pointing",
                    "text": "This is the Sugarwood Grove. Trees made of candy, rivers of syrup, and the worst toothache of your life."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_candy_03",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "Everything here is sweet. Everything. Even the things that shouldn't be."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_candy_04",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "...Can I ask you something?"
                },
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Sure."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_candy_05",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Do you like it here? This place. The whole... everything."
                },
                {
                    "who": "player",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "I think so. Why?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_candy_06",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "No reason! People leave, sometimes. Go too far. I like it when people stay, that's all."
                }
            ],
            "then": "hub"
        },
        "again": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "milo_candy_07",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "The candy makers here are nice. Sticky handshakes, though."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_candy_08",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "Don't drink from the syrup river. I'm not saying why. Just don't."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_candy_09",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "I like watching people walk by. You're the only one who walks that way, though."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_candy_10",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "You know what I like about this place? Nothing ever changes. Nothing."
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "Tell me about the candy makers.",
                    "goto": "makers"
                },
                {
                    "text": "What's past the forest?",
                    "goto": "past"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Bye, Milo.",
                    "goto": "bye"
                }
            ]
        },
        "hub": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "milo_candy_11",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "smile",
                    "text": "Anyway! What else?"
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "Tell me about the candy makers.",
                    "goto": "makers"
                },
                {
                    "text": "What's past the forest?",
                    "goto": "past"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Bye, Milo.",
                    "goto": "bye"
                }
            ]
        },
        "makers": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "milo_candy:makers"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "milo_candy_12",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "laugh",
                    "text": "They make everything out of sugar. Houses, chairs, spoons. One of them made a sugar hat. It melted in the rain."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_candy_13",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "thinking",
                    "text": "They're nice. They smile a lot. Maybe a little too much. Ever seen someone smile while sleeping? Like that."
                }
            ],
            "then": "hub"
        },
        "past": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "milo_candy:past"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "milo_candy_14",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "A village. Smaller than mine. Quieter."
                },
                {
                    "id": "milo_candy_15",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "After that the road splits. You'll see."
                }
            ],
            "then": "hub"
        },
        "bye": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "milo_candy_16",
                    "who": "milo",
                    "pose": "grin",
                    "text": "Watch your teeth."
                }
            ]
        }
    }
}
